msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫지젤………!"

#: search2:search2_6C1E3712_DB41_4FC0_9741_04C66D419C6C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ca563f42ebfb14ac12e021814dbf749b9e69e07ebf1b94c3799a2e45e28ebe2
#. default-sha256: 7536a491f8a7a815765bc7c4650611d3c394f4eaf9d9f1163447152c16ad6311
msgctxt "search2:search2_6C1E3712_DB41_4FC0_9741_04C66D419C6C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Everything comes back to me all at once.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s right... ⟪k:3⟫I watched Morgana "
"kidnap her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내가 겪은 모든 게 떠올랐다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그렇다――, ⟪k:3⟫나는 ⟪k:4⟫눈앞에서 지젤을 빼앗겼다."

#: search2:search2_317EB5A2_A2E1_46B1_839A_92BC9F210064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75bd8193af5fc4e734fbf547358bec7984b1ef0634e9399cd7a0f8eee33067dc
#. default-sha256: d17c06978212b75c42eeee5acc068e36fef296eb7d805d720473f95ce38b452e
msgctxt "search2:search2_317EB5A2_A2E1_46B1_839A_92BC9F210064"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched the witch drag her into the darkness...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫unable to reach her hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤의 손을 잡지 못 하여――,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어둠 너머로 빼앗기고 말았다……."

#: search2:search2_51530F60_E669_44C1_B5EB_FED125E8E7AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 419e0f3592e184db2c7f2b671cfa7e05a999a2bc53a0dab141572bb59ae83065
#. default-sha256: 753cd1e509f5b730b0bbd44a1ee882d74e0bfd47d8a3dfe9e3e98a39b31fc433
msgctxt "search2:search2_51530F60_E669_44C1_B5EB_FED125E8E7AF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Where are you, Morgana?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……어디 있어, ⟪k:1⟫모르가나……."

#: search2:search2_EB2CDF5B_8CBB_4B2C_84E0_E2665E7AD423
