msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……왜 ⟪k:1⟫안 열리지……."

#: search2:search2_96F73FBF_5BBB_4919_9815_440D63E09F0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d81eeb23ee739d3d43bd7b7699691e6ba36dbd73ac798296cd2683e8640cecd
#. default-sha256: 6085275d0a398afde6fe5661751c9d4696c8d75d16430cdbacf6ad919edbef45
