msgstr "⟪k:0⟫여기에…… ⟪k:1⟫잠금 장치가 있진 ⟪k:2⟫않았을 텐데……."

#: search2:search2_0FB7C85A_64C1_4CE4_AB67_F029F2EE8EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da0e7854dbf1d42068154588633d761a7682ca03e10fd34ea46a5c933479cca6
